{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "message"
        ]
      },
      "name": "Telegram Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "lookup",
        "sheetId": "REEMPLAZAR_CON_TU_ID",
        "range": "USUARIOS!A:E",
        "lookupColumn": "telegram_user",
        "lookupValue": "={{$json[\"message\"][\"from\"][\"id\"]}}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Validar Usuario",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        20,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "lookup",
        "sheetId": "REEMPLAZAR_CON_TU_ID",
        "range": "LOGS!A:E",
        "lookupColumn": "telegram_user",
        "lookupValue": "={{$node[\"Telegram Trigger\"].json[\"message\"][\"from\"][\"id\"]}}",
        "options": {
          "sort": [
            {
              "column": "timestamp",
              "direction": "DESC"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Obtener Estado Actual",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "dataType": "string",
        "value1": "={{$json[\"pantalla\"] || 'IDLE'}}",
        "rules": {
          "rules": [
            {
              "value2": "IDLE",
              "output": 0
            },
            {
              "value2": "MENU_PRINCIPAL",
              "output": 1
            },
            {
              "value2": "CREAR_TIPO",
              "output": 2
            }
          ]
        },
        "fallbackOutput": 0
      },
      "name": "Router de Estados",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{$node[\"Telegram Trigger\"].json[\"message\"][\"from\"][\"id\"]}}",
        "text": "Hola, soy HelpDeskBot 👋\n\nEstoy aquí para ayudarte con solicitudes de soporte de forma rápida y ordenada.\n\nPor favor escribe el número de la opción que quieras usar.\n\nMenú principal:\n0. Ayuda\n1. Crear solicitud\n2. Consultar estado\n3. Mis solicitudes\n4. Reportes\n5. Configuración",
        "replyMarkup": "ReplyKeyboardMarkup",
        "keyBoard": "1, 2, 3\n4, 5, 0",
        "resizeKeyboard": true
      },
      "name": "Enviar Menú Principal",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        750,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "sheetId": "REEMPLAZAR_CON_TU_ID",
        "range": "LOGS!A:E",
        "fields": [
          "timestamp",
          "telegram_user",
          "pantalla"
        ],
        "values": {
          "field": [
            {
              "name": "timestamp",
              "value": "={{$now}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "telegram_user",
              "value": "={{$node[\"Telegram Trigger\"].json[\"message\"][\"from\"][\"id\"]}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "pantalla",
              "value": "MENU_PRINCIPAL"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Actualizar Log a Menu",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1000,
        140
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "number": [
            {
              "value1": "={{$node[\"Telegram Trigger\"].json[\"message\"][\"text\"].toInt()}}",
              "operation": "equal",
              "value2": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Opción 1: Crear?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        750,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{$node[\"Telegram Trigger\"].json[\"message\"][\"from\"][\"id\"]}}",
        "text": "Vamos a crear una solicitud.\n\nSelecciona el tipo:\n1. Soporte técnico\n2. Solicitud administrativa\n3. Consulta general\n9. Cancelar",
        "replyMarkup": "ReplyKeyboardMarkup",
        "keyBoard": "1, 2, 3\n9",
        "resizeKeyboard": true
      },
      "name": "Preguntar Tipo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1000,
        280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "sheetId": "REEMPLAZAR_CON_TU_ID",
        "range": "LOGS!A:E",
        "fields": [
          "timestamp",
          "telegram_user",
          "pantalla",
          "resultado"
        ],
        "values": {
          "field": [
            {
              "name": "timestamp",
              "value": "={{$now}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "telegram_user",
              "value": "={{$node[\"Telegram Trigger\"].json[\"message\"][\"from\"][\"id\"]}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "pantalla",
              "value": "CREAR_TIPO"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Actualizar Log a Wizard 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1220,
        280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{$node[\"Telegram Trigger\"].json[\"message\"][\"from\"][\"id\"]}}",
        "text": "Ahora selecciona la prioridad:\n1. Alta\n2. Media\n3. Baja",
        "replyMarkup": "ReplyKeyboardMarkup",
        "keyBoard": "1, 2, 3",
        "resizeKeyboard": true
      },
      "name": "Preguntar Prioridad",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        750,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "sheetId": "REEMPLAZAR_CON_TU_ID",
        "range": "LOGS!A:E",
        "fields": [
          "timestamp",
          "telegram_user",
          "pantalla",
          "resultado"
        ],
        "values": {
          "field": [
            {
              "name": "timestamp",
              "value": "={{$now}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "telegram_user",
              "value": "={{$node[\"Telegram Trigger\"].json[\"message\"][\"from\"][\"id\"]}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "pantalla",
              "value": "CREAR_PRIORIDAD"
            },
            {
              "name": "resultado",
              "value": "={{$node[\"Telegram Trigger\"].json[\"message\"][\"text\"]}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Log Tipo y Mover a Prioridad",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1000,
        480
      ]
    }
  ],
